    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8dbe789d9c072fcba05f885",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一、二、三……\n视线不可以往下喔，\n看着我的眼睛吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5da07faa99936664e682f2b5498d8724a99a6319da9da413e735ae8828e99228",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
