    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a33468d9ce2cd26cb6eda16",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我勉强跟上她的舞步。\n虽然刚开始的脚步很笨拙，\n但是记住大略的顺序之后──",
      "source_fingerprint": "277a97ca5db14721c16f1c7f6b59700092bd1d4496b275f1f85d86e43f3ddddb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
