      "uid": "zhcn:6fc182e1e9cc81791623ee78",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "每踏出一步，\n她束起的头发便会随之摆荡──",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf35464d0c1e2e5aca3b361e2511caba67e57f3c4077b4acebfb56b0584ab549",
