    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc8643e8d513c78ba0f1e3ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她曾经说过，\n希望自己的表现能够让这套决胜服永远闪耀。",
